{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Under Ichigo Love me baby!!! in TOKYO SUPER ARENA 2025",
    "steam_appid": 3500840,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500840/extras/ddc43a8aefe1073bdb479728e2ab8c63.poster.avif?t=1741944078\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500840/extras/ddc43a8aefe1073bdb479728e2ab8c63.webm?t=1741944078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500840/extras/ddc43a8aefe1073bdb479728e2ab8c63.mp4?t=1741944078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rhythm action game based on the viral idol trio &quot;Under Ichigo&quot; is here! Their first solo arena show is fully recreated in real-time 3D!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take to the stage at one of Japan's largest venues, &quot;Tokyo Super Arena,&quot; meticulously replicated down to the smallest details.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy breathtaking productions featuring over 100 types of dynamic lighting and stage effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And that's not all - the movements, provided by expert motion actors, are recorded using professional motion capture technology, allowing us to capture every action, right down to their fingertips!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The simple, intuitive rhythm action gameplay makes getting to grips with the game a breeze, even for newbies to the genre!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 8 original songs for you to enjoy, with exclusive costumes for each, allowing you to fully savor the girls' evolving charm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One standout feature in this game is &quot;Live Customization.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select your favorite member to stand in the center position, change vocal parts, customize outfits, and create your own unique performance. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize your very own &quot;Under Ichigo&quot; experience! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game blends realistic live production, easy-to-learn yet hard-to-master rhythm action, and a high degree of customization. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Under Ichigo and create the ultimate live performance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500840/extras/627d59e4b524f2960c3a373b7aa89d2f.poster.avif?t=1741944078\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500840/extras/627d59e4b524f2960c3a373b7aa89d2f.webm?t=1741944078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500840/extras/627d59e4b524f2960c3a373b7aa89d2f.mp4?t=1741944078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About &quot;Under Ichigo&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500840/extras/da72a78d13167181a9121c25d58767ad.avif?t=1741944078\" width=512 height=288 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Love as sweet as strawberries, aimed straight at your heart!<br>Meet Under Ichigo, a three-member idol unit from LIGHTUP PROMOTION, featuring Himeka Momoyama, Miyu Yuzuhara, and Mei Aoyama!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500840/extras/8cc64e06ba48e40ee7908c546883c7eb.avif?t=1741944078\" width=512 height=288 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf38<strong>Himeka Momoyama (Momoyama Himeka \u2013 Ichigo Pink)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The spoiled princess of Under Ichigo! <br>Born into a family of entertainers, she's been in the industry since birth, so has lived a very sheltered life. <br>Nickname: Hime-chan</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500840/extras/1c1109392c3703ef165c3fbc618b83b2.avif?t=1741944078\" width=512 height=288 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf4bMiyu Yuzuhara (Yuzuhara Miyu \u2013 Ichigo Lemon)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The energetic style icon of Under Ichigo. <br>Shy but full of curiosity, she absolutely loves all things cute. <br>Nickname: MyuMyu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500840/extras/cd887e9e586eced9dc527d022e5efb07.avif?t=1741944078\" width=512 height=288 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc99Mei Aoyama (Aoyama Mei \u2013 Ichigo Blue)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The earnest leader of Under Ichigo. <br>A former child star, she dreams of becoming an actress in the future. <br>Nickname: MeiMei</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500840/extras/ddc43a8aefe1073bdb479728e2ab8c63.poster.avif?t=1741944078\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500840/extras/ddc43a8aefe1073bdb479728e2ab8c63.webm?t=1741944078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500840/extras/ddc43a8aefe1073bdb479728e2ab8c63.mp4?t=1741944078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rhythm action game based on the viral idol trio &quot;Under Ichigo&quot; is here! Their first solo arena show is fully recreated in real-time 3D!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take to the stage at one of Japan's largest venues, &quot;Tokyo Super Arena,&quot; meticulously replicated down to the smallest details.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy breathtaking productions featuring over 100 types of dynamic lighting and stage effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And that's not all - the movements, provided by expert motion actors, are recorded using professional motion capture technology, allowing us to capture every action, right down to their fingertips!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The simple, intuitive rhythm action gameplay makes getting to grips with the game a breeze, even for newbies to the genre!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 8 original songs for you to enjoy, with exclusive costumes for each, allowing you to fully savor the girls' evolving charm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One standout feature in this game is &quot;Live Customization.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select your favorite member to stand in the center position, change vocal parts, customize outfits, and create your own unique performance. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize your very own &quot;Under Ichigo&quot; experience! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game blends realistic live production, easy-to-learn yet hard-to-master rhythm action, and a high degree of customization. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Under Ichigo and create the ultimate live performance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500840/extras/627d59e4b524f2960c3a373b7aa89d2f.poster.avif?t=1741944078\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500840/extras/627d59e4b524f2960c3a373b7aa89d2f.webm?t=1741944078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500840/extras/627d59e4b524f2960c3a373b7aa89d2f.mp4?t=1741944078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About &quot;Under Ichigo&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500840/extras/da72a78d13167181a9121c25d58767ad.avif?t=1741944078\" width=512 height=288 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Love as sweet as strawberries, aimed straight at your heart!<br>Meet Under Ichigo, a three-member idol unit from LIGHTUP PROMOTION, featuring Himeka Momoyama, Miyu Yuzuhara, and Mei Aoyama!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500840/extras/8cc64e06ba48e40ee7908c546883c7eb.avif?t=1741944078\" width=512 height=288 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf38<strong>Himeka Momoyama (Momoyama Himeka \u2013 Ichigo Pink)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The spoiled princess of Under Ichigo! <br>Born into a family of entertainers, she's been in the industry since birth, so has lived a very sheltered life. <br>Nickname: Hime-chan</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500840/extras/1c1109392c3703ef165c3fbc618b83b2.avif?t=1741944078\" width=512 height=288 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf4bMiyu Yuzuhara (Yuzuhara Miyu \u2013 Ichigo Lemon)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The energetic style icon of Under Ichigo. <br>Shy but full of curiosity, she absolutely loves all things cute. <br>Nickname: MyuMyu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500840/extras/cd887e9e586eced9dc527d022e5efb07.avif?t=1741944078\" width=512 height=288 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc99Mei Aoyama (Aoyama Mei \u2013 Ichigo Blue)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The earnest leader of Under Ichigo. <br>A former child star, she dreams of becoming an actress in the future. <br>Nickname: MeiMei</p>",
